# 高频词汇 List02
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List02核心词汇

{{complex}}{/ˈkɒmpleks/}{复杂的；综合体}{The issue is far more complex than it first appears.}}
{{concentrate}}{/ˈkɒnsntreɪt/}{集中；专注}{Students should concentrate on their weaker subjects.}}
{{concern}}{/kənˈsɜːn/}{关心；担忧；涉及}{There is growing concern about data privacy.}}
{{conclude}}{/kənˈkluːd/}{得出结论；结束}{The report concluded that the policy was effective.}}
{{conduct}}{/kənˈdʌkt/}{进行；行为}{The researchers conducted a nationwide survey.}}
{{confirm}}{/kənˈfɜːm/}{确认；证实}{The test results confirmed the initial diagnosis.}}
{{conflict}}{/ˈkɒnflɪkt/}{冲突；矛盾}{The conflict between tradition and innovation continues.}}
{{consequence}}{/ˈkɒnsɪkwəns/}{后果；结果}{Climate change has serious consequences for agriculture.}}
{{consider}}{/kənˈsɪdər/}{考虑；认为}{We must consider all the options before deciding.}}
{{consist}}{/kənˈsɪst/}{由...组成；在于}{The panel consists of five independent experts.}}
{{constant}}{/ˈkɒnstənt/}{持续的；恒定的}{Innovation requires constant effort and investment.}}
{{construct}}{/kənˈstrʌkt/}{建造；构建}{The bridge was constructed using sustainable materials.}}
{{consume}}{/kənˈsjuːm/}{消耗；消费}{Modern society consumes enormous amounts of energy.}}
{{contact}}{/ˈkɒntækt/}{联系；接触}{Please contact our support team for assistance.}}
{{contain}}{/kənˈteɪn/}{包含；控制}{The report contains valuable data and analysis.}}
{{context}}{/ˈkɒntekst/}{上下文；背景}{The meaning of the word changes depending on the context.}}
{{contribute}}{/kənˈtrɪbjuːt/}{贡献；投稿}{Research and development contribute to economic growth.}}
{{control}}{/kənˈtrəʊl/}{控制；管理}{The government introduced measures to control inflation.}}
{{convince}}{/kənˈvɪns/}{说服；使确信}{The evidence convinced the jury of his innocence.}}
{{cooperate}}{/kəʊˈɒpəreɪt/}{合作；配合}{The two departments agreed to cooperate on the project.}}
{{create}}{/kriˈeɪt/}{创造；创建}{The policy aims to create more jobs in the region.}}
{{critical}}{/ˈkrɪtɪkl/}{批评的；关键的}{Critical analysis is a core skill in academic research.}}
{{crucial}}{/ˈkruːʃl/}{至关重要的}{Education is crucial for personal and national development.}}
{{decline}}{/dɪˈklaɪn/}{下降；拒绝}{Birth rates have been declining steadily.}}
{{define}}{/dɪˈfaɪn/}{定义；限定}{How we define success varies from person to person.}}
{{demonstrate}}{/ˈdemənstreɪt/}{证明；演示}{The study demonstrates the link between diet and health.}}
{{deny}}{/dɪˈnaɪ/}{否认；拒绝}{He denied all charges brought against him.}}
{{depend}}{/dɪˈpend/}{依赖；取决于}{The outcome will depend on several factors.}}
{{derive}}{/dɪˈraɪv/}{源自；获得}{The word derives from an ancient Greek term.}}
{{describe}}{/dɪˈskraɪb/}{描述；描绘}{The report describes the current state of the economy.}}
